---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE, CURRENT_YEAR } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What RouteToAbroad collects (enquiry fields only), what we never do (ads, third-party trackers), and how to reach us about your data."
  path="/privacy"
  noindex={false}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="Short, because the practice is short: we collect what your enquiry needs, and nothing else." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-text legal">
      <p class="legal-updated num">Last updated: November 2025</p>

      <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit an enquiry or form on this site, we collect the fields you fill in — typically your
        name, email, phone number, and the message or programme details you share. We use them only to
        respond to your enquiry and, if you proceed, to run your file.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What we never do</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no advertising cookies and runs no third-party tracking scripts. We do not sell,
        rent, or share your data with marketers. Full stop.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Functional storage</h2>
      <p>
        Two small pieces of state live in your browser's local storage: your light/dark theme preference and
        your saved progress on the document checklist tool. Neither leaves your device.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Form processing</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry forms are delivered to our team through Formspree (Formspree, Inc.), which processes the
        submission on our behalf solely to deliver it to us. Our AI assistant, if you use it, sends the
        conversation to our language-model provider to generate replies; conversations are not used for
        advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry correspondence is kept while your file is active and for a reasonable period afterwards for
        service and legal reasons. Ask us to delete your data and we will, subject to record-keeping
        obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask what we hold about you, ask for corrections, or ask for deletion — write to
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We respond within one working week.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: {SITE.email} · {SITE.phoneIndia} · {SITE.offices[0].street}, {SITE.offices[0].city}.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-foot">© {CURRENT_YEAR} {SITE.name}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
  }

  .legal p {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-foot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
</style>
